# One-off data import — real user feedback, never commit to the repo.
# Both paths: the file lived at migrations/0002_* before the per-database split,
# and wrangler now auto-applies everything under migrations/feedback/, so an
# unignored copy there would be committed AND re-run against production — where
# the ledger records only 0001, 0003 and 0004, so every imported row would double.
migrations/0002_import_legacy_feedback.sql
migrations/**/0002_import_legacy_feedback.sql
